# {{lb|en|uncommon}} {{place|en|@synonym of:Warsaw|capital city|c/Poland|;|capital city|voi/Masovian Voivodeship}}.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1942|month=June|author=w:Antoni Gronowicz|chapter_tlr=Jessie McEwen|chapter=Village|title=Bolek|location=Edinburgh&#59; New York, N.Y.&#59; Toronto, Ont.|publisher=[[w:Thomas Nelson (publisher)|Thomas Nelson and Sons]]|year_published=August 1944 (2nd printing)|page=8|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/bolek0000anto/page/8/mode/1up|oclc=14042540|passage=Joseph had never been to '''Warszawa''' but often, as he stood on the high, chalky banks of the great river, Wisla, and watched it winding its course far away, he dreamed of a journey he would like to make in an airplane.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1973|author=A. S. Sohi; V. C. Kapoor|title=A Note on the Cicadellid, ''Erythroneura cassiae'' Ahmed|editor=J. M{{quote-gloss|ichael}} Chalmers-Hunt|journal=[[w:The Entomologist's Record and Journal of Variation|The Entomologist’s Record and Journal of Variation]]|volume=85|location=Arbroath, Angus|publisher=T. Buncle & Co.|pages=217–218|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/entomologistsrec851973tutt/page/218/mode/1up|issn=0013-8916|oclc=1568053|passage=After comparing with this species, we thought ours as a new species due to the presence of apical aedeagal processes. Later, Dworakowska of '''Warszawa''', Poland, suggested that ours is the same as that of Ahmed, and this character might have been missed by him.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2019|author=Irina Rodica Rabeja|chapter=Scientific Work Years|title=Marie Sklodowska Curie: Her Contribution to Science|location=Sydney, N.S.W.|publisher=Irina Rabeja|page=64|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/mariesklodowskac0000irin/page/64/mode/1up|isbn=9780977509836|passage=Marie Curie was never a Polish citizen, though her family were Polish nationalists. At the time of her departure from '''Warszawa''', the Polish state simply did not exist.}}

